{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56155","headline":"送神颂 · 杜光庭","name":"送神颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渺渺空无象，悠悠感有情。\n敬则承天贶，泄则被魔精。\n吉凶随运起，否泰应缘生。\n道贵珠玉，神惟在至诚。\n丹碧尽勤苦，恳欵竭中情。\n自然通大圣，皆得降明灵。\n捻香陈所愿，稽首冀嘉祯。\n天尊常寂静，回心礼杳冥。\n（同前卷五十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}